    },
    {
      "id": "claim_681273e81b6442fdb5fd53175ac3580c",
      "statement": "One private reader classifies a session folder as absent (ENOENT only), unreadable (invalid JSON, envelope-schema failure, unrecognised schemaVersion, id-versus-directory mismatch, or any filesystem refusal), or read; load resolves undefined for absent and rejects for unreadable, while list drops both non-read classes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/server/src/adapters/session-store/filesystem-session-store.ts#L172-L223",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fded3ea06a588404d47efa500be99db66abe86f3e6b3bb8e7ddb5579dacc48f2:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/server/src/adapters/session-store/filesystem-session-store.ts#L66-L113",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:25beea1a9cb7a32ee3ca4f50068a08526a84352ad613bd369959950eab6d66bc:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://specs/_decision/003-add-filesystem-session-store.md#L5-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2e7b8b9d95098e277e1b4ec4bd4738051c598d419252adf828bdfcdea1c0bf4d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c7d385f89c434973bd7f581f0919f09e",
      "statement": "list returns the readable identifiers in ascending lexicographic order and performs a full envelope read per entry, so it reports only identifiers that load will answer and does not vary with the filesystem's own ordering.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/server/src/adapters/session-store/filesystem-session-store.ts#L66-L91",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:475ac8d13683389c2e5655d7a606c855c1f56c979ffdd9ee74ddf74d8fca73fe:"
        },
        {
