    {
      "id": "claim_c8dac154e0b043a19b85a7ee307bd422",
      "statement": "The adapter's test suite runs fully hermetically on two seams: a per-test mkdtemp sandbox with storeRoot one level below it that the store creates itself, and a vi.mock of node:fs/promises whose injection modes observe sync/rename order and fail a handle's write, sync, close, or a staged file's removal; there is no *.live.test.ts for this adapter.",
