    {
      "id": "claim_1be20e47b203433ca713eed9610f3d41",
      "statement": "The renderer belongs to whoever owns the state: @chrysalyst/core ships the interview's renderTranscript and the composition root passes it into the store config; a caller storing a different TState needs no renderer and the store still never interprets what it holds, which is why the three unchanged 003 scenarios stay green and two new scenarios (header fallback, renderer-throws) are added.",
